+/**
+ * Bumped when a committed cover crosses the wide/tall band.
+ * Read from measure, not from the parent composition, so the grid remeasures without recomposing.
+ *
+ * Harmony: app code increments this on the main thread. Same-band ratio changes must not.
+ */
+val PanoramaMasonryContentEpoch = mutableIntStateOf(0)
+
